## Project: Website Redesign 🚀

**Goal:** To redesign the company website for improved user experience and brand alignment.

**Phase 1: Research & Planning (2 weeks)**

*   **Competitive Analysis:** 🔍 Research competitor websites for best practices.
*   **User Research:** 🧑‍💻 Conduct surveys and interviews to understand user needs.
*   **Content Audit:** 📝 Review existing website content for accuracy and relevance.
*   **Information Architecture:** 🗺️ Define the website’s structure and navigation.
*   **Wireframing:** 🎨 Create low-fidelity wireframes to visualize page layouts.
*   **Mood Board:** 🎨 Develop a visual style guide for the new design.

**Phase 2: Design & Development (4 weeks)**

*   **UI Design:** 🎨 Develop high-fidelity mockups based on the mood board.
*   **Prototyping:** 💻 Build interactive prototypes to test user flows.
*   **Front-End Development:** 💻 Implement the design using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
*   **Back-End Development:** 💻 Develop the server-side logic and database integration.
*   **Content Migration:** 📝 Migrate existing content to the new website.

**Phase 3: Testing & Launch (1 week)**

*   **Usability Testing:** 🧑‍💻 Conduct user testing to identify and fix usability issues.
*   **Cross-Browser Testing:** 🌐 Test the website on different browsers and devices.
*   **Performance Testing:** ⏱️ Optimize the website for speed and performance.
*   **Launch:** 🚀 Deploy the new website to the live server.

**Key Stakeholders:**

*   Marketing Team 📣
*   Development Team 💻
*   Design Team 🎨
*   Product Team 🚀

**Risks:**

*   Delayed content migration ⏳
*   Technical challenges with new CMS 🚧
*   Scope creep ⚠️